          "path": "docs/install.md",
          "sha256": "ea1019e47a2acc0af7395616809331ef80ea549eaabc52fece0025ed9102bfea",
          "start_line": 5,
          "text": "The standalone installer accepts macOS 11 or newer on Apple Silicon and Intel, plus x86-64 Linux with glibc 2.35 or newer. On Linux, it parses `getconf GNU_LIBC_VERSION` and refuses musl, an older glibc, a missing `getconf`, or an invalid result before download or mutation under `HOME`. Use a newer glibc host or build with Rust 1.95 when that preflight fails.\n"
        }
